neath-rising-seas-in-2016-a-life-size-sculpture-now-marks-the-site-and-will-gradually-become-a-habitat-for-seabirds-coral-and-marine-life/articleshow/132787146.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/kale-island-disappeared-beneath-rising-seas-in-2016-a-life-size-sculpture-now-marks-the-site-and-will-gradually-become-a-habitat-for-seabirds-coral-and-marine-life/articleshow/132787146.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-01T16:11:02+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132787158,imgsize-514980.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[His grandfather paid $2,200 for an Allis-Chalmers tractor in 1953; 62 years later, Kevin Klahn bought it back and restored it]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132786790.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Kevin Klahn restored his grandfather's 1953 tractor after buying it back.  This vintage Allis-Chalmers WD tractor became a symbol of family heritage.  The meticulous restoration project took many hours of dedicated work.  It preserved the machine's original character and historical significance.  The tractor returned home, representing dedication and enduring family bonds.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/his-grandfather-paid-2200-for-an-allis-chalmers-tractor-in-1953-62-years-later-kevin-klahn-bought-it-back-and-restored-it/articleshow/132786790.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/his-grandfather-paid-2200-for-an-allis-chalmers-tractor-in-1953-62-years-later-kevin-klahn-bought-it-back-and-restored-it/articleshow/132786790.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-01T15:56:24+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132786963,imgsize-141283.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Act of aggression against Iran’: Araghchi warns UK over US access to British military bases]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132786734.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Iran's foreign minister warned Britain that allowing US strikes from its bases is aggression.  He stated this action grants Iran the right to self-defense under international law.  British Prime Minister Andy Burnham approved continued US military base access for operations.  Burnham also reaffirmed UK commitment to maritime security efforts in the Strait of Hormuz.  London maintains it is not part of any war with Iran and supports diplomacy.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/act-of-aggression-against-iran-araghchi-warns-uk-over-us-access-to-british-military-bases/articleshow/132786734.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/act-of-aggression-against-iran-araghchi-warns-uk-over-us-access-to-british-military-bases/articleshow/132786734.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-01T16:31:21+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Karan Manral</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132787580,imgsize-61576.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Rose Metcalf helped guide 400 people off the sinking Costa Concordia, signalled rescuers with her earring]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132787324.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In a dramatic turn of events aboard the Costa Concordia, Rose Metcalf, a dancer, played a pivotal role in the life-saving efforts. She rallied crew members to create a human chain, ensuring safe evacuation amidst panic. Innovatively, Metcalf descended the ship's side to reach the water's edge and signaled a rescue helicopter with a makeshift light. Her courage and resourcefulness were instrumental in saving lives during that dire night.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/on-her-first-day-at-work-a-23-year-old-dancer-rose-metcalf-helped-guide-400-people-off-the-sinking-costa-concordia-and-signalled-rescuers-with-her-earring/articleshow/132787324.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/on-her-first-day-at-work-a-23-year-old-dancer-rose-metcalf-helped-guide-400-people-off-the-sinking-costa-concordia-and-signalled-rescuers-with-her-earring/articleshow/132787324.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-01T16:30:38+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132787399,imgsize-159868.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Major US Black university mandates business suits, bans certain headwear in new dress code ]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132786860.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/mandatory-business-suits-headwear-ban-major-us-black-universitys-new-dress-code-sparks-row/articleshow/132786860.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/mandatory-business-suits-headwear-ban-major-us-black-universitys-new-dress-code-sparks-row/articleshow/132786860.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-01T15:54:44+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132786915,imgsize-148451.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Go that way': Migrants say Moroccan authorities directed them towards Spain's Ceuta]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132785872.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Moroccan migrants reported encouragement from authorities and social media messages.  Thousands crossed into Spain's Ceuta enclave, with many returning due to hardship.  At least sixty-seven people died during the unprecedented border crossing event.  Spain is reinforcing the Ceuta border after tens of thousands entered.  The crisis has sparked political tensions and renewed migration policy debates.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/go-that-way-migrants-say-moroccan-authorities-directed-them-towards-spains-ceuta/articleshow/132785872.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/go-that-way-migrants-say-moroccan-authorities-directed-them-towards-spains-ceuta/articleshow/132785872.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-01T16:03:07+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Trisha Mahajan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132787051,imgsize-1326312.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Air India expands Canada network with new Mumbai-Toronto flights, upgrades Delhi route]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132787894.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/air-india-launches-mumbai-toronto-non-stop-flights-upgrades-delhi-route-with-new-boeing-787-9/articleshow/132787894.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/air-india-launches-mumbai-toronto-non-stop-flights-upgrades-delhi-route-with-new-boeing-787-9/articleshow/132787894.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-01T17:16:50+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/e